{"id":"61959d7f01578dbb5f596372d09bd8d7fca40a9b","axis":"silent","repo":"infection/infection","sha":"61959d7f01578dbb5f596372d09bd8d7fca40a9b","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"src/TestFramework/PhpUnit/Adapter/PhpUnitAdapterFactory.php","lines":["@@ -101,7 +101,6 @@ public static function create(","             Paths::makeAbsolute(","                 $sourceDirectories,","                 $sourceDirectoryBasePath,","-                canonicalize: true,","             ),","         );","         Assert::notEmpty(","@@ -127,7 +126,7 @@ public static function create(","                 $configManipulator,","                 new XmlConfigurationVersionProvider(),","                 $fileSystem,","-                $sourceDirectories,","+                $absoluteSourceDirectories,","                 array_map(","                     static function (SplFileInfo $fileInfo): string {","                         $realPath = $fileInfo->getRealPath();"],"additions":1,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/e2e/PHPUnit13_Custom_Config_Dir/.gitignore","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@","+/composer.lock","+/var/*","+/vendor/","+!/var/.gitkeep"],"additions":4,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/e2e/PHPUnit13_Custom_Config_Dir/README.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@","+# PHPUnit 13 with a custom configuration directory","+","+This scenario was first added as `PHPUnit_Custom_Config_Dir`, later renamed","+`PHPUnit9_Custom_Config_Dir`. This version runs the same scenario with PHPUnit 13.","+","+The PHPUnit configuration lives in `build/phpunit.xml`. All paths in the PHPUnit","+and Infection configurations are relative.","+","+This checks that Infection resolves each path against the configuration that","+contains it and preserves PHPUnit's configured source coverage."],"additions":10,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/e2e/PHPUnit13_Custom_Config_Dir/build/phpunit.xml","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@","+<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>","+<phpunit xmlns:xsi=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\"","+         xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation=\"../vendor/phpunit/phpunit/phpunit.xsd\"","+         bootstrap=\"../vendor/autoload.php\"","+         colors=\"true\"","+         cacheDirectory=\"../var/phpunit-cache\"","+>","+    <testsuites>","+        <testsuite name=\"Test Suite\">","+            <directory>../tests/</directory>","+        </testsuite>","+    </testsuites>","+","+    <source>","+        <include>","+            <directory>../src/</directory>","+        </include>","+    </source>","+</phpunit>"],"additions":19,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/e2e/PHPUnit13_Custom_Config_Dir/composer.json","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@","+{","+    \"require-dev\": {","+        \"phpunit/phpunit\": \"~13.3.0\"","+    },","+    \"autoload\": {","+        \"psr-4\": {","+            \"PHPUnit13CustomConfigDir\\\\\": \"src/\"","+        }","+    },","+    \"autoload-dev\": {","+        \"psr-4\": {","+            \"PHPUnit13CustomConfigDir\\\\Test\\\\\": \"tests/\"","+        }","+    },","+    \"minimum-stability\": \"dev\",","+    \"prefer-stable\": true","+}"],"additions":17,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/e2e/PHPUnit13_Custom_Config_Dir/expected-output.txt","lines":["rename from tests/e2e/PHPUnit_Custom_Config_Dir/expected-output.txt","rename to tests/e2e/PHPUnit13_Custom_Config_Dir/expected-output.txt"],"additions":0,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/e2e/PHPUnit13_Custom_Config_Dir/infection.json","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@","+{","+    \"timeout\": 25,","+    \"threads\": 1,","+    \"source\": {","+        \"directories\": [","+            \"src\"","+        ]","+    },","+    \"logs\": {","+        \"summary\": \"var/infection.log\"","+    },","+    \"phpUnit\": {","+        \"configDir\": \"build\"","+    },","+    \"mutators\": {","+        \"PublicVisibility\": true","+    },","+    \"tmpDir\": \"var/infection-tmp\"","+}"],"additions":19,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/e2e/PHPUnit13_Custom_Config_Dir/run_tests.bash","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,31 @@","+#!/usr/bin/env bash","+","+cd \"$(dirname \"$0\")\"","+","+if [ $(php -r 'echo version_compare(PHP_VERSION, \"8.4.1\", \"<\");') ]; then","+    echo \"Skipping test it needs PHP 8.4.1 or higher (found $(php -r 'echo PHP_VERSION;'))\"","+    exit 0","+fi","+","+readonly INFECTION=../../../${1}","+","+set -eo pipefail","+","+if [ \"$DRIVER\" = \"phpdbg\" ]","+then","+    phpdbg -qrr $INFECTION","+else","+    php $INFECTION","+fi","+","+if [ -f \"var/infection.log\" ]; then","+    LOG_FILE=\"var/infection.log\"","+else","+    LOG_FILE=\"infection.log\"","+fi","+","+if [ -n \"$GOLDEN\" ]; then","+    cp -v \"$LOG_FILE\" expected-output.txt","+fi","+","+diff -u --ignore-all-space expected-output.txt \"$LOG_FILE\""],"additions":31,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/e2e/PHPUnit13_Custom_Config_Dir/src/SourceClass.php","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@","+<?php","+","+namespace PHPUnit13CustomConfigDir;","+","+class SourceClass","+{","+    public function hello(): string","+    {","+        return 'hello';","+    }","+}"],"additions":11,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/e2e/PHPUnit13_Custom_Config_Dir/tests/SourceClassTest.php","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@","+<?php","+","+namespace PHPUnit13CustomConfigDir\\Test;","+","+use PHPUnit13CustomConfigDir\\SourceClass;","+use PHPUnit\\Framework\\TestCase;","+","+class SourceClassTest extends TestCase","+{","+    public function test_hello(): void","+    {","+        $sourceClass = new SourceClass();","+        $this->assertSame('hello', $sourceClass->hello());","+    }","+}"],"additions":15,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/e2e/PHPUnit13_Custom_Config_Dir/var/.gitkeep","lines":[],"additions":0,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/e2e/PHPUnit13_Custom_Config_Dir_Without_Source/.gitignore","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@","+/composer.lock","+/var/*","+/vendor/","+!/var/.gitkeep"],"additions":4,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/e2e/PHPUnit13_Custom_Config_Dir_Without_Source/README.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@","+# PHPUnit 13 with a custom configuration directory and no source coverage","+","+This scenario was first added as `PHPUnit_Custom_Config_Dir`, later renamed","+`PHPUnit9_Custom_Config_Dir`. This version uses PHPUnit 13 without source","+coverage configured.","+","+The PHPUnit configuration lives in `build/phpunit.xml`. Infection configures two","+source directories in a single run:","+","+- Relative `src`, which must resolve against the Infection configuration directory","+  rather than PHPUnit's `build/` directory. The generated Infection configuration","+  lives in a temporary directory with a `src` link to the fixture's source.","+- An absolute path containing a symbolic link followed by `../extra-src`. The","+  link points to `build/`, so the filesystem resolves the path to the fixture's","+  `extra-src/`. Canonicalization would instead select the nonexistent `extra-src/`","+  inside the temporary directory.","+","+Each directory contains a tested class. The expected summary requires two killed","+mutants, so losing coverage for either directory fails the scenario.","+","+The script explicitly configures `pcov.directory` to include the scenario. PCOV's","+automatic directory selection canonicalizes paths independently of PHPUnit's","+coverage configuration."],"additions":23,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/e2e/PHPUnit13_Custom_Config_Dir_Without_Source/build/phpunit.xml","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@","+<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>","+<phpunit xmlns:xsi=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\"","+         xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation=\"../vendor/phpunit/phpunit/phpunit.xsd\"","+         bootstrap=\"../vendor/autoload.php\"","+         colors=\"true\"","+         cacheDirectory=\"../var/phpunit-cache\"","+>","+    <testsuites>","+        <testsuite name=\"Test Suite\">","+            <directory>../tests/</directory>","+        </testsuite>","+    </testsuites>","+</phpunit>"],"additions":13,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/e2e/PHPUnit13_Custom_Config_Dir_Without_Source/composer.json","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@","+{","+    \"require-dev\": {","+        \"phpunit/phpunit\": \"~13.3.0\"","+    },","+    \"autoload\": {","+        \"psr-4\": {","+            \"PHPUnit13CustomConfigDirWithoutSource\\\\\": [\"src/\", \"extra-src/\"]","+        }","+    },","+    \"autoload-dev\": {","+        \"psr-4\": {","+            \"PHPUnit13CustomConfigDirWithoutSource\\\\Test\\\\\": \"tests/\"","+        }","+    },","+    \"minimum-stability\": \"dev\",","+    \"prefer-stable\": true","+}"],"additions":17,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/e2e/PHPUnit13_Custom_Config_Dir_Without_Source/expected-output.txt","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@","+Total: 2","+","+Killed by Test Framework: 2","+Killed by Static Analysis: 0","+Errored: 0","+Syntax Errors: 0","+Escaped: 0","+Timed Out: 0","+Skipped: 0","+Ignored: 0","+Not Covered: 0"],"additions":11,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/e2e/PHPUnit13_Custom_Config_Dir_Without_Source/extra-src/ExtraSourceClass.php","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@","+<?php","+","+namespace PHPUnit13CustomConfigDirWithoutSource;","+","+class ExtraSourceClass","+{","+    public function hello(): string","+    {","+        return 'hello';","+    }","+}"],"additions":11,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/e2e/PHPUnit13_Custom_Config_Dir_Without_Source/infection.json","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@","+{","+    \"timeout\": 25,","+    \"threads\": 1,","+    \"source\": {","+        \"directories\": [","+            \"src\"","+        ]","+    },","+    \"logs\": {","+        \"summary\": \"var/infection.log\"","+    },","+    \"phpUnit\": {","+        \"configDir\": \"build\"","+    },","+    \"mutators\": {","+        \"PublicVisibility\": true","+    },","+    \"tmpDir\": \"var/infection-tmp\"","+}"],"additions":19,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/e2e/PHPUnit13_Custom_Config_Dir_Without_Source/run_tests.bash","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,42 @@","+#!/usr/bin/env bash","+","+cd \"$(dirname \"$0\")\"","+","+if [ $(php -r 'echo version_compare(PHP_VERSION, \"8.4.1\", \"<\");') ]; then","+    echo \"Skipping test it needs PHP 8.4.1 or higher (found $(php -r 'echo PHP_VERSION;'))\"","+    exit 0","+fi","+","+readonly INFECTION=../../../${1}","+","+set -eo pipefail","+","+SYMLINK_DIRECTORY=$(mktemp -d)","+readonly SYMLINK_DIRECTORY","+trap 'rm -rf \"$SYMLINK_DIRECTORY\"' EXIT","+","+ln -s \"$PWD/src\" \"$SYMLINK_DIRECTORY/src\"","+ln -s \"$PWD/build\" \"$SYMLINK_DIRECTORY/source-link\"","+","+php -r '","+    $configuration = json_decode(file_get_contents(\"infection.json\"), true, flags: JSON_THROW_ON_ERROR);","+    $configuration[\"source\"][\"directories\"][] = $argv[1] . \"/source-link/../extra-src\";","+    $configuration[\"phpUnit\"][\"configDir\"] = getcwd() . \"/build\";","+    $configuration[\"logs\"][\"summary\"] = getcwd() . \"/var/infection.log\";","+    $configuration[\"tmpDir\"] = getcwd() . \"/var/infection-tmp\";","+","+    echo json_encode($configuration, JSON_THROW_ON_ERROR);","+' \"$SYMLINK_DIRECTORY\" > \"$SYMLINK_DIRECTORY/infection.json\"","+","+if [ \"$DRIVER\" = \"phpdbg\" ]","+then","+    phpdbg -qrr -d pcov.directory=\"$PWD\" \"$INFECTION\" --configuration=\"$SYMLINK_DIRECTORY/infection.json\" --initial-tests-php-options=\"-d pcov.directory=$PWD\"","+else","+    php -d pcov.directory=\"$PWD\" \"$INFECTION\" --configuration=\"$SYMLINK_DIRECTORY/infection.json\" --initial-tests-php-options=\"-d pcov.directory=$PWD\"","+fi","+","+if [ -n \"$GOLDEN\" ]; then","+    cp -v var/infection.log expected-output.txt","+fi","+","+diff -u --ignore-all-space expected-output.txt var/infection.log"],"additions":42,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/e2e/PHPUnit13_Custom_Config_Dir_Without_Source/src/SourceClass.php","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@","+<?php","+","+namespace PHPUnit13CustomConfigDirWithoutSource;","+","+class SourceClass","+{","+    public function hello(): string","+    {","+        return 'hello';","+    }","+}"],"additions":11,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/e2e/PHPUnit13_Custom_Config_Dir_Without_Source/tests/SourceClassTest.php","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,22 @@","+<?php","+","+namespace PHPUnit13CustomConfigDirWithoutSource\\Test;","+","+use PHPUnit13CustomConfigDirWithoutSource\\ExtraSourceClass;","+use PHPUnit13CustomConfigDirWithoutSource\\SourceClass;","+use PHPUnit\\Framework\\TestCase;","+","+class SourceClassTest extends TestCase","+{","+    public function test_hello(): void","+    {","+        $sourceClass = new SourceClass();","+        $this->assertSame('hello', $sourceClass->hello());","+    }","+","+    public function test_extra_source_hello(): void","+    {","+        $sourceClass = new ExtraSourceClass();","+        $this->assertSame('hello', $sourceClass->hello());","+    }","+}"],"additions":22,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/e2e/PHPUnit13_Custom_Config_Dir_Without_Source/var/.gitkeep","lines":[],"additions":0,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/e2e/PHPUnit9_Custom_Config_Dir/README.md","lines":["rename from tests/e2e/PHPUnit_Custom_Config_Dir/README.md","rename to tests/e2e/PHPUnit9_Custom_Config_Dir/README.md"],"additions":0,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/e2e/PHPUnit9_Custom_Config_Dir/build/phpunit.xml","lines":["rename from tests/e2e/PHPUnit_Custom_Config_Dir/build/phpunit.xml","rename to tests/e2e/PHPUnit9_Custom_Config_Dir/build/phpunit.xml"],"additions":0,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/e2e/PHPUnit9_Custom_Config_Dir/composer.json","lines":["rename from tests/e2e/PHPUnit_Custom_Config_Dir/composer.json","rename to tests/e2e/PHPUnit9_Custom_Config_Dir/composer.json"],"additions":0,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/e2e/PHPUnit9_Custom_Config_Dir/expected-output.txt","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@","+Total: 1","+","+Killed by Tes